<title>FRANCE: Generale des Eaux unit sells CGES stake.</title>
<headline>Generale des Eaux unit sells CGES stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux said on Monday its Esys-Montenay energy management unit had sold its 41.52 percent stake in the Compagnie Generale Europeenne de Stockage (CGES) for an asset gain of 50 million francs.</p>
<p>It added the operation would cut group debt by 150 million francs.</p>
</text>
